{
  "name": "Alustriel’s Mooncloak",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Moonlight fills a 20-ft Emanation around you (Dim Light): you and your allies in it have Half Cover and Resistance to Cold, Lightning and Radiant damage. While it lasts you can end it early for one option: <strong>Liberation</strong> - when you fail a save to avoid or end the Frightened, Grappled or Restrained condition, take a Reaction to succeed instead (offered automatically); <strong>Respite</strong> - as a Magic action, you or an ally in the area regains 4d10 + your spellcasting modifier Hit Points (activity).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
